   362	  **Training-only saturation check** at $256^2$ (where all 51 steps fit, 15 GB): POD from the 12-step set versus POD from
   363	  all 29,376 states; statistic = RMS relative projection error of all 29,376 training states at each rank. Adequate iff the
   364	  12-step value ≤ 1.10 × the all-step value at every registered rank. If not adequate, the $256^2$ cell uses the all-step
