   401	(the earlier citation `t2core.tol_of` was wrong). Certification is a separate untimed pass over the saved trajectory
   402	$c_0..c_N$ (speed3d's pattern): for every step it recomputes $\hat r$ and $J$ at $c_{n+1}$ with the history of that
   403	step and records $\gamma_n$; a step counts as stationary iff $\gamma_n\le10^{-3}$, or its residual is at the solve's
   404	residual tolerance ($\|\hat r\|\le$ tol, an exact root; t2core A1.5). Timed queries do not certify (no extra work in
