  1176	**A16.1 Name and claims.** The ECSW arm is "**ECSW with support-targeted greedy NNLS**": the Petrov–Galerkin ECSW
  1177	gradient-matching NNLS of Grimberg et al., sampled at support targets $\kappa r$ instead of stopped at a training-residual
  1178	tolerance (the published stopping rule). For every configuration the actual support, the training relative residual at
  1179	the checkpoint, construction failures and Q1 are reported. No claim that this grid guarantees a strong or unbiased
  1180	baseline is made.
