  1111	expected to certify an advection basis at p_max = 2,048 / 4,096 (in smk1 the 2D state POD's numerical rank was 1,652).
  1112	The maximal Q-DEIM B-QR in the smoke is therefore a memory/shape pilot that may use an uncertified p_max (recorded),
  1113	and acceptance certifies the advection POD only at the p the smoke actually runs (p_s and the N-under ladder). In
  1114	production, A6.1 applies unchanged: a p not certified on the full snapshot set is not constructible.
